        "kcal": 1200,
        "line": "🍽️ You push half your bowl across the fire to Emma — 'eat. You need it more than I do.' Emma doesn't argue. The bowl comes back scraped clean."
      },
      {
        "day": 102,
        "vid": "emma_larsen",
        "kcal": 1200,
        "line": "🍽️ Thin day. Your bowl stays half-full — the other half goes to Emma, who's been quiet about being hungry."
      },
      {
        "day": 124,
        "vid": "emma_larsen",
        "kcal": 1200,
        "line": "🍽️ The bins are thin, and Emma looks it. You set your second half in front of Emma. 'Eat,' you say. Emma eats like someone making up for days."
      },
      {
        "day": 146,
        "vid": "tariq_mahmood",
        "kcal": 600,
        "line": "🍽️ You wave off the second scoop and nod toward Tariq. 'Tariq eats first tonight.' Nobody at the fire disagrees."
      }
    ]
